<title>USA: Classic Restaurants plans merger.</title>
<headline>Classic Restaurants plans merger.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Classic Restaurants International Inc said Thursday it had signed a letter of intent to merge with a major food and beverage group.</p>
<p>The company did not name its merger partner.</p>
<p>It said it plans to release further details within a week.</p>
</text>
